{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game content primarily consists of light-hearted &quot;Roguelike&quot; elements and various mini-games. You will play as a soul seeking its memory, traversing different spaces to understand the protagonist's story, challenge diverse levels, unlock different characters, and discover hidden worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.poster.avif?t=1769786491\" width=432 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.webm?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.mp4?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Points (Spirit Power)</strong></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During level challenges, you can modify character attributes using temporary points obtained from killing monsters. Make your own choices and enjoy the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/bc811664f649abe2d35dc10b16124625.poster.avif?t=1769786491\" width=374 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/bc811664f649abe2d35dc10b16124625.webm?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/bc811664f649abe2d35dc10b16124625.mp4?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple main scenes. Explore these scenes to obtain permanent points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7401e55d9118a161fd14042b2d323af6.avif?t=1769786491\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Formation and Magical Items</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Chinese novels, these are the spells and props you can use, each possessing powerful abilities and unique functions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/6d385a89a4f7b27b887a8dd17824e7db.avif?t=1769786491\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you can unlock different characters, each with unique base attributes, attack methods, and magical items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/573f93ddda405cfe86a21d14559c70ca.avif?t=1769786491\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Cracks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen carefully and find the windmills in the scenes; they connect to fragments of space and memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete or experience these mini-games to earn rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/a05664b732853409441e2be4cdf435c2.avif?t=1769786491\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521030?t=1769786491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3521030?t=1769786491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/52fd10140f144ae9409cbf4cc9a499bce8b5fd4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769786491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/52fd10140f144ae9409cbf4cc9a499bce8b5fd4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769786491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3697420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game content primarily consists of light-hearted &quot;Roguelike&quot; elements and various mini-games. You will play as a soul seeking its memory, traversing different spaces to understand the protagonist's story, challenge diverse levels, unlock different characters, and discover hidden worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.poster.avif?t=1769786491\" width=432 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.webm?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7a5feb76281de19c27b806f752df16f5.mp4?t=1769786491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Points (Spirit Power